# 统一行尾与文件类型，避免 Windows/Linux 换行差异造成"整文件改动"的假 diff。
# 背景（2026-10-01）：sim/controller.py、src/adc_bridge.v、tb/adc_bridge_tb.v 都出现过
# 纯 CRLF/LF 差异导致 git diff 显示 399 增 399 删、而 --ignore-all-space 为空的假变更。
# 规则：文本文件统一以 LF 存入仓库并在工作区使用 LF；二进制文件不做转换。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制/生成物：禁止行尾转换与 diff 文本化
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.rar  binary
*.7z   binary
*.fs   binary
*.bin  binary
*.binx binary
*.db   binary
*.vcd  binary
*.vvp  binary
*.pyc  binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary

# 明确文本类型（便于 diff 与合并）
*.v     text
*.sv    text
*.vh    text
*.cst   text
*.sdc   text
*.tcl   text
*.py    text
*.md    text
*.txt   text
*.json  text
*.c     text
*.h     text
*.ps1   text
